  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds IByteShelfClient.GetServerVersionAsync, the release the server runs and its deploy id, for any signed-in user or shelf key. The HTTP client asks the server, which needs ByteShelf server 2.3.0; the in-memory client, having no server, answers this package's own version. IByteShelfClient gains a member, so an implementation outside ByteShelfClient must follow. IShelfClient.SetGrantAsync now throws ArgumentException for a permission that is none of the ShelfAccessPermission values, before anything is sent, in the HTTP client and the in-memory one alike (ByteShelfCommon's ShelfGrants.ValidatePermission); the HTTP client failed with a JsonException and the in-memory one with a ByteShelfException. See https://github.com/AdamTovatt/byte-shelf/blob/client-v3.1.0/ByteShelfClient/README.md",
